productionWellFormed_proj (gs : KelGroups.GroupState State) :
  Reactivegas.productionWellFormed gs = !KelGroups.GroupView.isMember comuneId (KelGroups.groupView gs)
'productionWellFormed_proj' does not depend on any axioms
"RESTORATION-P01-TRUE-P07-FALSE"
